WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.667
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.989
- I've never worn matching costumes.

00:00:10.989 --> 00:00:12.338
- I think this is the first time

00:00:12.338 --> 00:00:14.031
I'm celebrating Halloween with my cat.

00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:15.929
- Last year was her first Halloween,

00:00:15.929 --> 00:00:18.066
put a dress on her, which she got off

00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:19.793
in approximately 30 seconds.

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:22.930
- We put her in a little
Halloween costume,

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:25.590
and have her greet trick-or-treater's.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.625
- She's a rescue story, or
I guess I'm a rescue story.

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.930
And all of this fur
are just fur sprinkles.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.076
For, for everybody.

00:00:33.076 --> 00:00:36.243
(lively upbeat music)

00:00:39.349 --> 00:00:40.915
- So I'm gonna draw out of here

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.943
what my costume's gonna be, let's see.

00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:44.360
- Lilo and Stich!

00:00:45.276 --> 00:00:48.284
- Holy Hound and Naughty Nun.

00:00:48.284 --> 00:00:50.761
(laughs) What!

00:00:50.761 --> 00:00:52.803
- King Crab and Mermaid Princess.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:54.522
Am I the mermaid princess?

00:00:54.522 --> 00:00:57.772
(upbeat music)
- Look!

00:01:01.733 --> 00:01:02.726
- [Matt] Oh my god.

00:01:02.726 --> 00:01:05.309
(upbeat music)

00:01:06.637 --> 00:01:07.870
- This is the most covered up

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.454
I've ever been in my entire life.

00:01:09.454 --> 00:01:12.037
(upbeat music)

00:01:12.878 --> 00:01:15.275
- Oh my god, Jolene, you look so cute!

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:17.405
(laughing) Hi sweetie.

00:01:17.405 --> 00:01:19.745
- This is the cutest thing I've ever seen.

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:21.443
- Look it, you're already surfing.

00:01:21.443 --> 00:01:22.733
Are you surfing?

00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:24.802
(singing Hawaiian tune)

00:01:24.802 --> 00:01:28.667
- I don't know why her boobs
are on her back, that's weird.

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:32.541
- It's hard to find plus sized
costumes for cats nowadays,

00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:36.246
I think there's an initiative
to keep cats skinny.

00:01:36.246 --> 00:01:38.356
She's a kitty with
curves, and this costume's

00:01:38.356 --> 00:01:40.134
just a little bit snug on her.

00:01:40.134 --> 00:01:41.995
- This costume's a good weight loss plan,

00:01:41.995 --> 00:01:43.437
I've already lost three pounds.

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:45.842
- I feel like we look really cool.

00:01:45.842 --> 00:01:48.908
- I would totally wear this
costume out with my cat.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:51.362
- Matching costumes, it can come off

00:01:51.362 --> 00:01:53.256
as borderline creepy I think.

00:01:53.256 --> 00:01:55.506
(laughing)

00:01:56.952 --> 00:02:01.119
(laughing)
(creepy instrumental music)

00:02:02.894 --> 00:02:05.082
(metal sign creaking)

